1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,140
Diamonds are not rare.

2
00:00:02,140 --> 00:00:04,790
You were told they are.

3
00:00:05,440 --> 00:00:08,080
Master, I'll buy a diamond ring for the wedding!

4
00:00:08,080 --> 00:00:14,330
I'll give my love a diamond ring and prove how strong my love is!

5
00:00:14,330 --> 00:00:17,220
But I don't have the money, so I'll take a loan!

6
00:00:17,670 --> 00:00:21,690
Diyor, who said love is in a diamond?

7
00:00:22,140 --> 00:00:23,550
Everybody knows it!

8
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,680
In movies, in ads.

9
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,960
Diyor, listen.

10
00:00:28,960 --> 00:00:32,250
1938, America.

11
00:00:32,900 --> 00:00:39,860
The world's biggest diamond company hires an advertising agency.

12
00:00:39,860 --> 00:00:40,690
The task:

13
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:44,870
make people think a diamond is the sign of love.

14
00:00:45,520 --> 00:00:45,990
1947.

15
00:00:45,990 --> 00:00:49,710
One slogan is written:

16
00:00:49,710 --> 00:00:52,040
“A diamond is forever”.

17
00:00:52,040 --> 00:01:00,900
Later it was named the most famous ad slogan of the century.

18
00:01:01,350 --> 00:01:03,420
No way!

19
00:01:03,420 --> 00:01:04,660
A slogan?!

20
00:01:05,310 --> 00:01:10,240
On TV, in newspapers, in movies — everywhere:

21
00:01:10,240 --> 00:01:13,520
a ring must have a diamond, they said.

22
00:01:13,520 --> 00:01:16,150
Later the ads said:

23
00:01:16,150 --> 00:01:20,420
spend two months' salary on the ring.

24
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:23,510
You're not buying love.

25
00:01:23,510 --> 00:01:25,400
You're buying a loan.

26
00:01:26,050 --> 00:01:30,700
So my love wants me, not the diamond?

27
00:01:31,360 --> 00:01:32,290
God willing.

28
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:35,170
Three questions.

29
00:01:35,170 --> 00:01:37,820
Can you buy this ring without a loan?

30
00:01:37,820 --> 00:01:39,860
How many months will you pay after the wedding?

31
00:01:39,860 --> 00:01:42,100
Did you talk it over with your love?

32
00:01:42,750 --> 00:01:49,730
They don't sell you a stone, they sell you the feeling that “love costs this much”.

33
00:01:49,730 --> 00:01:51,060
Always ask:

34
00:01:51,060 --> 00:01:53,720
who profits from this?

35
00:01:54,370 --> 00:01:57,620
Send the list of your wedding costs to our bot:

36
00:01:57,620 --> 00:01:58,580
@sahiychishopbot.

37
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:04,320
It works out the total and the extra you pay on the loan, and where you can save.

